Derived components, with their upstream sources:

  lib/src/window_cutter.dart
      packages/cc_infra/lib/src/meetings/meeting_transcription_service.dart
      (rolling-window cut policy, silent-window skip, in-order decoding)

  lib/src/batch_pipeline.dart
      packages/cc_infra/lib/src/meetings/meeting_transcription_service.dart
      (per-stream generation guard, decode serialization)

  lib/src/hallucination_filters.dart
      packages/cc_infra/lib/src/meetings/meeting_transcription_service.dart
      (isNonSpeechArtifact, isRepetitionHallucination,
       isHallucinatedBoilerplate, and their curated phrase set)

  lib/src/echo_filter.dart
      packages/cc_infra/lib/src/meetings/meeting_echo_filter.dart
      (one-directional containment dedup, adaptive hold, token normalization)

  lib/src/speech_activity.dart
      packages/cc_domain/lib/features/meetings/domain/services/
      speech_activity_detector.dart
      (energy gate and unanimity combinator)

Portions of the accompanying tests are likewise derived from the corresponding
Control Center test suites.
